Description: AI-powered browser with built-in agent capabilities
 Atlas Browser is a Chromium-based web browser with an integrated AI agent
 that can help you automate tasks, navigate the web, and interact with
 web pages using natural language.
 .
 Features:
  - AI Agent for browser automation
  - Privacy protection with tracker blocking
  - Modern, clean interface
  - Cross-platform support
